{"path":"utility/functional/divides_void","title":"std::divides<void>","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>divides&lt;void&gt;","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/divides_void","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"std::divides<void> is a specialization of std::divides with parameter and return type deduced.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/functional\">&lt;functional&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx14\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> divides<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/divides\"><span class=\"kw1039\">std::<span class=\"me2\">divides</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span> is a specialization of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/divides\">std::divides</a></span> with parameter and return type deduced.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>is_transparent</code>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional#Transparent_function_objects\">unspecified</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-